Benchmark corpus and documentation assets
-----------------------------------------

The MIT License above applies to the N.148/N.148i source code, benchmark
programs, generated measurements and plots, and original project
documentation authored by Micilini Roll.

It does not relicense third-party photographs or artworks distributed in
`images/corpus-*.ppm`. Each corpus image remains under the public-domain,
CC0, or CC BY license recorded for that individual work in
`images/CREDITS.txt` and `benchmarks/v1/corpus-manifest.json`. The source author,
source page, license, and license URL in those files are part of the required
attribution and must be retained when redistributing the corpus. The committed
PPMs are normalized adaptations: they were resized, converted to sRGB, stripped
of metadata, and flattened where an alpha channel was present. Exact conversion
arguments are recorded per image in the manifest.

`docs/assets/readme/corpus-grid.png` is a montage derived from eight corpus
images and remains subject to their respective source licenses and
attributions, listed in `docs/assets/readme/README.md`.

`images/example.ppm` and the README comparison images derived from it are
project fixtures by Micilini Roll and are distributed under the MIT License
above.
